  "question": {
    "text": "An interference is observed due to two coherent sources <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> separated by a distance <math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math>&nbsp;along Y-axis where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math>&nbsp;is the wavelength of the light source used. A detector&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is moved along the positive X-axis. Find the total number of maxima points are observed on the X-axis excluding the points <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></math>?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image2-21347f2d-a766-4d47-ad6c-a1080891c256.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "To obtain maxima the path difference<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math>      ...(i)<br/><br/>Form  <math><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></math>  ABD,<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math> <br/><br/> <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>For  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/>So the total no. of maxima points observed are 3.",
